The '''Scavenger Matron''' is the 2nd boss in Enshrouded.

They drop one of the key ingredients for upgrading the [[Flame Altar]] to Level 3: the [[Scavenger Matron Helmet]].

There are variations of this boss:
* [[Scavenger Gorger Matron|Gorger]]: Throws poison in 3 directions toward her target
* [[Scavenger Grizzler Matron|Grizzler]]: Summons reinforcements

