The '''Fell Monstrosity''' is a boss in Enshrouded.

It can be found near strange, calcified statues and was created by the Sorcerer Ikora while experimenting with [[Shroud Spores]] using the Black Cauldron (the Monstrosity in the Cradle of Dusk is Ikora herself). It drops the key ingredient for the [[Flame Altar|Flame Altar's]] fourth upgrade, the [[Fell Monstrosity Head]].

