==Abilities==
'''Shroud Spray''' — Leans back and launches Shroud projectiles at targeted areas.

'''Shroud Breath''' — Deals Shroud damage in a line in front of the boss.

'''Calcified Statues''' — Arenas containing a Fell Monstrosity will have immobile humanoid statues scattered around the arena. Upon contact, a statue can either break into nothing, or can spawn a [[Fell Berserker]]. These Fell can only drop [[Runes]] and potentially their [[Soldier's Broadsword]].

