'''Fell Banshees''' are a moderately powerful [[Fell]] encountered in the [[Shroud]] in many biomes of [[Embervale]].

'''Banshees''' can be found at various points of interest in the Shroud: [[Elixir Well|Elixir Wells]], ruined villages, and [[Shroud Lairs]] are all common '''Banshee''' territories. They patrol their areas by gliding through the air and attack intruders with Fell magicks.

==Attacks==
In combat, '''Banshees''' launch two magic bolts which deal Shroud damage on contact.
These bolts travel quickly and are able to home-in on players should they run. It is suggested to use terrain, walls, or debris to take cover from the bolts before they land.

Some variants can briefly turn invisible and teleport during combat.

'''Banshees''' are easiest to deal with using [[Weapons|ranged or magic weapons]]. Players using melee will find them difficult, as they can frequently float out of reach.

A good trick for dealing with individual '''Banshees''' is to stay decently close and dodge forward when they cast. This will cause the magic bolts to impact harmlessly on the ground behind you.

