'''Fell Sporeheads''' are a dangerous [[Fell]] enemy encountered in dungeons, ruins, and abandoned villages in the [[Shroud]]. 

'''Sporeheads''' tend to keep their distance from the player, launching Fell spores at them from afar while other Fell enemies engage in the fight.

==Attacks==
'''Spore Spew''' - Sporeheads will charge up a barrage of Fell spores, indicated by a swirling blue mist around their head, and release them at the player. These inflict moderate Shroud damage if they hit.

'''Spore Drip''' - If a Sporehead's fungal head is destroyed, it can no longer use its barrage attack but will continuously leak individual Fell spores, which seek out and damage the player.

A good method to deal with Sporeheads is by keeping them stunned with melee attacks. Avoid targeting their heads with ranged or magic attacks.

