'''Fell Footsoldiers''' are common [[Fell]] enemies that are found in the Shroud of all biomes throughtout [[Embervale]].

'''Footsoldiers''' are slow, relatively weak enemies that patrol around populated areas in the Shroud, namely [[Elixir Well]]s and [[Shroud Root]]s.

==Attacks==
Each '''Footsoldier''' uses slightly different attacks depending on the type of weapon they wield. 

Soldiers equipped with a '''short sword''' or '''sword and shield''' will slowly get within melee range before taking fairly predictable swipes at the player.

'''Spear'''-wielding soldiers are able to perform a rushing stab attack to close distances, and attack with sweeping chops up close.

In later areas, '''footsoldiers''' can be armored, and carry sturdy weapons. These soldiers are tougher, and will often attack slightly faster than their weaker counterparts.

