'''Fell Berserkers''' are common [[Fell]] enemies that can be encountered in the Shroud of all biomes in [[Embervale]]

They are fast-moving and vicious, rushing to assault any nearby players with their broadswords and maces.

==Behavior==
Upon spotting a player, '''Fell Berserkers''' will alert other nearby Fell with a war cry before rushing to attack. They will always close any distance by sprinting toward the player and launching at them with a powerful weapon swing.

Up close, berserkers will periodically take heavy swings at the player, or use their weapon to block incoming attacks.

They are best dealt with by stunning them with well-timed parries or magic.

