'''Fell Rangers''' are common [[Fell]] enemies that can be encountered in the Shroud of all biomes in [[Embervale]]

They prefer to attack the player from a distance, firing arrows and throwing Shroud bombs while their melee counterparts fight up close.

==Behavior==
Upon spotting a player, '''Fell Rangers''' will shout to alert other nearby Fell and begin firing projectiles. If the player comes too close, the Ranger will retreat to a moderate distance before resuming its attacks.

Rangers attack by firing arrows from their bows, dealing damage should they hit the player. Occasionally they will throw a small blue explosive that deals moderate damage and leaves behind a small cloud of dense Shroud.

