The '''Vukah Shaman''' is a [[Vukah]] that provides support to fellow Vukah by using magic during battle.

They are found living in Vukah settlements with their brethren. On death they drop a myriad of different materials, these materials do '''not''' change with their home biome.

In their normal state, variants differ in their defenses: Shock (Resisted or Neutral).

== Behavior ==
The Shaman will try to keep their distance from the player and will run away if they are approached.

If nearby Vukah are injured, healing Shaman will use beam magic to restore their health.

Combat Shaman will summon bolts of lightning to attack the player. A small blue circle will appear on the ground shortly before the bolt strikes.

