The '''Scavenger Scrapgun''' is a [[Scavenger]] enemy that can be encountered in most biomes throughout [[Embervale]]. 

They wear ragged and torn clothes, and carry large improvised weapons that launch scrap projectiles and explosives.

==Attacks==
=== Ballista Scrapgun ===
'''Spike Shot''' - The '''scrapgun''' will fire a small cluster of spiked projectiles at the player. This shot has a high spread, so being further away will prevent most from hitting.

'''Bomb Lob''' - In between spike shots, the '''scrapgun''' fires a small explosive at the player's feet that will detonate after a short timer. The '''scrapgun''' will use this attack even if the player is in melee range.

=== Mortar Scrapgun ===
'''Bomb Lob''' - This attack works the same for the Ballista and Mortar variants. A small explosive will be launched at the player's feet.

'''Scrap Bombardment''' - The '''scrapgun''' will begin firing multiple explosives at the player's location, similar to the Bomb Lob attack. The player must keep moving to avoid being caught in multiple explosions.

