'''Mushroom Crabs''' are a peaceful sentient plant commonly encountered in the forests of [[Revelwood]].

They are timid by nature, and will attempt to scuttle away from any who might approach. If cornered, they will release a small cloud of poisonous spores to defend themselves before attempting to escape.

Damaging the green poison sacks on their sides will cause them to drop without needing to kill the crab. On death, they drop any remaining poison sacks and a small number of [[penny Bun|Penny Bun mushrooms]].

