'''Drak Broodwardens''' are fierce reptilian fighters that can be encountered guarding Drak villages and settlements in the [[Veilwater Basin]].

They fight with their spears using leaping lunges and wide sweeping attacks. Like all Drak, they can drop Drak scales, teeth, and blood.

==Attacks==
'''Leaping Lunge''' - The Drak Broodwarden will close distances by performing an aerial lunge at the player with their spear. This deals heavy piercing damage on a hit.

'''Spear Sweep''' - In melee, the Drak Broodwarden will perform a three-hit combo with his spear using wide sweeps and chops.

