'''Drak Priests''' are potent Drak magic-users that guard Drak temples in the [[Veilwater Basin]].

They fight by summoning magic orbs to target the player and deal water damage. Like all Drak, they can drop Drak scales, teeth, and blood.

==Attacks==
'''Water Field Orb''' - The Priest will summon a golden water orb that emanates a field of water damage. This orb slowly pursues the player briefly before popping in a small explosion.

'''Water Balloon''' - The Priest will summon a fast-moving golden water orb that rushes at the player and deals heavy water damage on contact.

==Tips==
The Priest's orbs can be destroyed using [[weapons|ranged]] or [[weapons|magic]] attacks.

