'''Drak Chieftains''' are fierce reptilian fighters that can be encountered guarding Drak villages and settlements in the [[Veilwater Basin]].

They fight with their axe using slashing and smashing attacks. Like all Drak, they can drop Drak teeth, blood, scales, and claws.

==Attacks==
'''Slashing Axe''' - The Drak Chieftain will slash at the player with his axe. This deals moderate piercing damage on a hit.

'''Earth Smash''' - In melee, the Drak Chieftain will smash the ground with his axe, causing earth spikes to jut up where he strikes it and glow yellow.  This causes heavy damage.

'''Grappling Hook''' - The Drak Chieftain will throw his hook at the player and grapple them, then pull them to him.  He usually follows this up with his Slashing Axe attack.

==Tips==
His attacks can be avoided by jumping, dodging, and blinking away from and over him.  His movement is not fast.

